  Small pictures for menus, lists and task buttons.

  glyph-*  7x7 shapes. Menus draw them in the color of the text beside them
           (dim at rest, bright under the pointer), so they stay quiet.
  mark-*   5x5 marks for list rows, such as unread articles.
